-- CA.seg: Setzer (APAL 92, 1998), Section 4.2: the sets C^a(A), tau^A(a),
-- M(A) and A^A(B) (Definition 4.5), the properties of C^a(A) that Section 4
-- assumes (Assumption 4.4, proved by Setzer as Lemma 5.5), Lemma 4.7 and
-- Lemma 4.9.  The mirror is tools/otsec4.py; every statement was tested on
-- it first (python3 otsec4.py agree / lem47 / lem49 / split; the forms proved
-- here, which drop hypotheses of (e) and state 4.9(e)'s WD for A n a~: ca47, ca49e).
--
-- Classes.  A class Cl(N) is a predicate T -> U lv.  A n a is
-- {x in A | x <' a} (Cap A a).  Setzer quantifies over classes only
-- schematically; here a class is an argument of each lemma, and no lemma
-- takes a hypothesis quantified over classes.
--
-- C^a(A) (Def. 5.3/5.4, Assumption 4.4).  The least set Y with A n a c Y,
-- 0, I in Y, closed under +, phi, Omega, and under psi_kappa for a <' kappa.
-- Since the clauses refer to proper subterms, it is a recursion on d:
--   0, I:                in;
--   (d0, ds) (head d0), phi_b c:  d in A n a, or both parts in;
--   Omega_b:             d in A n a, or b in;
--   psi_kappa c:         d in A n a, or (a <' kappa and kappa, c in);
-- and C^a(A) = OT n that (C).  Setzer's Def. 5.3 splits a sum d =NF' b + c
-- at its LAST summand c (Def. 2.11); here a sum is split at its head, which
-- is a structural recursion on right-nested sums.  The two definitions
-- differ (d = (e, e, 1), A = {(e, e)}, a = Omega_2, e = psi_{Omega_1} 0: d is
-- in Setzer's set, not in ours).  They agree on every test with A n a
-- weakly downward closed (z =NF' x + y in A n a => x, y in A), the case of
-- Setzer's uses; this is tested, not proved.
--
-- Lemma 4.9(e) is stated for a =NF b + c with any split, and is false for
-- both definitions (otsec4.py split, lem49e):
--   last split: A = {(e, 1)}, a = (Omega_1, e, 1) = Omega_1 + (e, 1);
--   head split: A = {(e, 1), 1}, a = (Omega_1, e, 1, 1) = (Omega_1, e, 1) + 1;
-- in both A c M(A), the parts are in (A n a~) u (M(A) \ a~), and a is not in
-- M(A).  Setzer's proof cites 4.4(c), which is for =NF' only.  It holds when
-- A n a~ is weakly downward closed for sums (z =NF' x + y in A n a~ => x, y
-- in A, Def. 4.14(a)); that holds in its only use with a sum, 4.17(ii), by
-- Lemma 4.16(b).  We prove 4.9(e) with that hypothesis.
--
-- Assumption 4.4 = Lemma 5.5, for a in OT (here: any a):
--   (a) C^a(A) c OT                                           ca-ok
--   (b) 0, I in C^a(A)                                        ca-zero, ca-I
--   (c) d =NF phi_b c, (b, c) head/tail, Omega_b:
--       d in C^a(A) iff d in A n a or the parts are in C^a(A)  ca-phi, ca-plus, ca-om
--   (d) d =NF psi_kappa c:  d in C^a(A) iff d in A n a or
--       (a <' kappa and kappa, c in C^a(A))                   ca-psi
--       Setzer's two cases are this one with a <' kappa true or false.
--
-- Definition 4.5:  tau^A(a) = C^a(A) n a;  A^A(B) = {y in M(A) | tau^A(y) c B};
--   M(A) = {y in OT | y in C^y(A)}.                           tau, scA, M
--
-- Lemma 4.7 (a, b in OT):
--   (h) A n a n OT c C^a(A)                                   rem47h
--       (Setzer: A n a c C^a(A); C^a(A) c OT, so A c OT is needed or
--       x in OT, as in his uses.)
--   (d) a <' Omega_1 => C^a(A) = OT                            rem47d
--   (b) A c M(A), a <=' b => C^b(A) c C^a(A)                   rem47b
--   (a) A c M(A) => C^a(A) = C^{a~}(A)                         rem47a
--   (c) A c M(A), B c M(B), A n a~ = B n a~ => C^a(A) = C^a(B)   rem47c
--   (e) psi_I a <=' b, c <' I => C^b(A) n C_I(a) = C^c(A) n C_I(a)   rem47e
--       (Setzer also assumes A c M(A) and a in C_I(a); the proof uses neither,
--       only a in T'.  a in C_I(a) is what lets (e) apply at u = a.)
--   (f) A c M(A), a <' kappa, d = psi_kappa c in OT, z = min{a, d}:
--       d in C^a(A) iff d in A n a~ or kappa, c in C^z(A)       rem47f
--   (g) A c M(A), b~ <=' c, b^{-I} = c^{-I} =>
--       C^b(A) n (b~+1) = C^c(A) n (b~+1)                      rem47g
--       (Setzer's b^{-1} read as b^{-I}; otsec4.py lem47 shows it fails without it.)
-- Lemma 4.9:
--   (a) A c M(A), b <=' a => tau^A(a) n b c tau^A(b)            rem49a
--   (b) A c M(A), b <=' a, b~ = a~ => tau^A(b) = tau^A(a) n b    rem49b
--   (c) a <' Omega_1 => tau^A(a) = OT n a                       rem49c
--   (d) 0, I in M(A)                                           rem49d
--   (e) A c M(A), b, c in (A n a~) u (M(A) \ a~) (Good):
--       a =NF phi_b c, a =NF Omega_b => a in M(A)              rem49e-phi, rem49e-om
--       a =NF b + c, A n a~ weakly downward closed for sums (WDC: z in A n a~,
--       z =NF' x + y => x, y in A n a~) => a in M(A)           rem49e-sum
--       (WDC is stated for the class A n a~; with x, y <' x + y it is "x, y in A",
--       the form of Def. 4.14(a); that comparison is not proved here.)
--
-- Facts about cardinals used (section "Cardinals"), kappa in R n OT:
--   psi_kappa y <' kappa  (psi_kappa y in OT)                  psi-lt
--     kappa = I: clause (8);  kappa = Omega'_e: clause (6), pi = kappa.
--   kappa = Omega_s for some s in OT                           r-omF
--     I = Omega_I;  Omega'_e = Omega_e as e is neither 0 nor in Fi.
--   kappa <=' a => kappa <=' a~   (a~ the largest cardinal <=' a)  r-tilde
--     Remark 2.14 (proof of (b): card-M) at s of r-omF.
--   Omega_1 <=' kappa                                          r-om1
--     kappa = I: Omega_1 <' I (closed computation);  kappa = Omega'_e,
--     e in Suc: 1 <=' e, so Omega'_1 <=' Omega'_e.
--
-- Proof of 4.7(a), (b) (Setzer: "We show under the assumption A c M(A) and
-- a~ <=' b that C^b(A) c C^a(A)").  Down(x): for all a, b in OT with
-- a~ <=' b, x in C^b(A) => x in C^a(A).  By induction on x.  0, I: (b) of
-- 4.4.  Otherwise, by (c), (d) of 4.4, for every c:
--     x in C^c(A)  iff  x in A n c  or  P(c),
-- where P(c) says that the parts of x are in C^c(A), and for x = psi_kappa y
-- also that c <' kappa.  P(b) => P(a): the parts by induction; for psi,
-- b <' kappa gives a <' kappa, since kappa <=' a would give
-- kappa <=' a~ <=' b (r-tilde).  It remains x in A n b.  If x <' a, x is in
-- A n a.  Otherwise a <=' x; x in A c M(A), so x in C^x(A), and not by
-- x in A n x (x <' x is false), so P(x); and a~ <=' a <=' x, so P(a).
-- This step is one lemma (down-step), instantiated for each kind of x.
--   (b): a <=' b gives a~ <=' a <=' b.  (a): C^a c C^{a~} by Down with
--   (a~, a), since (a~)~ <=' a~ <=' a (2.14(b), (f)); C^{a~} c C^a by Down
--   with (a, a~).
-- Proof of 4.7(c): C^a(A) is monotone in A n a, by induction on x (each
-- clause of 4.4 is monotone in A n a) (ca-mono); then C^a(A) = C^{a~}(A)
-- c C^{a~}(B) = C^a(B) by (a), and symmetrically.
-- Proof of 4.7(h): one clause of 4.4 for each kind of x.  4.7(d): by
-- induction on x in OT; a psi_kappa y is in by its parts, since
-- a <' Omega_1 <=' kappa (r-om1).
-- Proof of 4.9: (a) from 4.7(b); (b) from 4.7(a) at a and b; (c) from
-- 4.7(d); (d) from 4.4(b).
-- Proofs of 4.7 (e), (f), (g) and 4.9(e): in the comment of their sections.

level lv ;
import OT ;
import OTLaws ;
import OTTrans ;
import OTC ;
import OTF ;
open OT ;
open OTLaws[lv] ;
open OTTrans[lv] ;
open OTC[lv] ;
open OTF[lv] ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Logic

data Or (P Q : U lv) : U lv = inl (p : P) | inr (q : Q) ;

either (P Q R : U lv) (f : P -> R) (g : Q -> R) : Or P Q -> R = split {
  inl p -> f p ; inr q -> g q } ;

orMap (P Q P' Q' : U lv) (f : P -> P') (g : Q -> Q') (h : Or P Q) : Or P' Q' =
  either P Q (Or P' Q') (\ p -> inl (f p)) (\ q -> inr (g q)) h ;

Iff (P Q : U lv) : U lv = (P -> Q) * (Q -> P) ;
-- the two directions; P and Q are explicit (matching implicit ones opens P)
fw (P Q : U lv) (e : Iff P Q) : P -> Q = e.1 ;
bw (P Q : U lv) (e : Iff P Q) : Q -> P = e.2 ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Classes

Cl : U (lv+) = T -> U lv ;

-- A n a
Cap (A : Cl) (a : T) : Cl = \ x -> A x * LT x a ;

-- A c B
Sub (A B : Cl) : U lv = (x : T) -> A x -> B x ;

-- transitivity on OT
trOT (x y z : T) (ox : OK x) (oy : OK y) (oz : OK z) : Tr3 x y z = tr3 x y z (ot-T x ox) (ot-T y oy) (ot-T z oz) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- C^a(A) (Def. 5.3/5.4, by recursion on d; head split of sums)

-- the clause for psi_kappa c, with u = (a <' kappa): Or o r if u, o otherwise
psiC : Bool -> U lv -> U lv -> U lv = split {
  false -> \ o r -> o ; true -> \ o r -> Or o r } ;

cin (a : T) (A : Cl) : T -> U lv = split {
  zero -> One ;
  plus x0 xs | r0 rs -> Or (Cap A a (plus x0 xs)) (r0 * rs) ;
  phi x0 x1 | r0 r1 -> Or (Cap A a (phi x0 x1)) (r0 * r1) ;
  psi x0 x1 | r0 r1 -> psiC (lt a x0) (Cap A a (psi x0 x1)) (r0 * r1) ;
  om x0 | r0 -> Or (Cap A a (om x0)) r0 ;
  ii -> One } ;

-- by definition of psiC and cin, stated once
psiC-t (o r : U lv) : (u : Bool) -> Tr u -> Iff (psiC u o r) (Or o r) = split {
  false -> \ h -> abF h ; true -> \ h -> (\ x -> x, \ x -> x) } ;
psiC-f (o r : U lv) : (u : Bool) -> Id Bool u false -> Iff (psiC u o r) o = split {
  false -> \ h -> (\ x -> x, \ x -> x) ; true -> \ h -> abT h } ;

cin-zero (a : T) (A : Cl) : cin a A zero = tt ;
cin-I (a : T) (A : Cl) : cin a A ii = tt ;
cin-plus (a : T) (A : Cl) (x0 xs : T)
  : Iff (cin a A (plus x0 xs)) (Or (Cap A a (plus x0 xs)) (cin a A x0 * cin a A xs)) = (\ x -> x, \ x -> x) ;
cin-phi (a : T) (A : Cl) (x0 x1 : T)
  : Iff (cin a A (phi x0 x1)) (Or (Cap A a (phi x0 x1)) (cin a A x0 * cin a A x1)) = (\ x -> x, \ x -> x) ;
cin-om (a : T) (A : Cl) (x0 : T)
  : Iff (cin a A (om x0)) (Or (Cap A a (om x0)) (cin a A x0)) = (\ x -> x, \ x -> x) ;
cin-psi (a : T) (A : Cl) (x0 x1 : T)
  : Iff (cin a A (psi x0 x1)) (psiC (lt a x0) (Cap A a (psi x0 x1)) (cin a A x0 * cin a A x1)) = (\ x -> x, \ x -> x) ;

opaque psiC ;
opaque cin ;

-- C^a(A) = OT n cin
C (a : T) (A : Cl) (d : T) : U lv = OK d * cin a A d ;
ca-mk (a : T) (A : Cl) (d : T) (o : OK d) (h : cin a A d) : C a A d = (o, h) ;
ca-ok (a : T) (A : Cl) (d : T) (h : C a A d) : OK d = h.1 ;
ca-in (a : T) (A : Cl) (d : T) (h : C a A d) : cin a A d = h.2 ;
opaque C ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Assumption 4.4 (= Lemma 5.5)

-- (b)
ca-zero (a : T) (A : Cl) : C a A zero = ca-mk a A zero (refl true) (cin-zero a A) ;
ca-I (a : T) (A : Cl) : C a A ii = ca-mk a A ii (refl true) (cin-I a A) ;

-- (c), for a term x with parts y, z: cin of x is "x in A n a, or cin of the
-- parts", and OK x gives OK of the parts
ca-two (a : T) (A : Cl) (x y z : T) (o : OK x) (oy : OK y) (oz : OK z)
  (e : Iff (cin a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) (cin a A y * cin a A z)))
  : Iff (C a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) (C a A y * C a A z)) =
  (\ h -> orMap (Cap A a x) (cin a A y * cin a A z) (Cap A a x) (C a A y * C a A z)
            (\ p -> p) (\ q -> (ca-mk a A y oy q.1, ca-mk a A z oz q.2))
            (fw (cin a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) (cin a A y * cin a A z)) e (ca-in a A x h)),
   \ h -> ca-mk a A x o (bw (cin a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) (cin a A y * cin a A z)) e
            (orMap (Cap A a x) (C a A y * C a A z) (Cap A a x) (cin a A y * cin a A z)
              (\ p -> p) (\ q -> (ca-in a A y q.1, ca-in a A z q.2)) h))) ;

-- the same with one part
ca-one (a : T) (A : Cl) (x y : T) (o : OK x) (oy : OK y)
  (e : Iff (cin a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) (cin a A y)))
  : Iff (C a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) (C a A y)) =
  (\ h -> orMap (Cap A a x) (cin a A y) (Cap A a x) (C a A y)
            (\ p -> p) (\ q -> ca-mk a A y oy q)
            (fw (cin a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) (cin a A y)) e (ca-in a A x h)),
   \ h -> ca-mk a A x o (bw (cin a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) (cin a A y)) e
            (orMap (Cap A a x) (C a A y) (Cap A a x) (cin a A y) (\ p -> p) (\ q -> ca-in a A y q) h))) ;

ca-plus (a : T) (A : Cl) (x0 xs : T) (o : OK (plus x0 xs))
  : Iff (C a A (plus x0 xs)) (Or (Cap A a (plus x0 xs)) (C a A x0 * C a A xs)) =
  ca-two a A (plus x0 xs) x0 xs o (ot-plus0 x0 xs o) (ot-plusS x0 xs o) (cin-plus a A x0 xs) ;

ca-phi (a : T) (A : Cl) (x0 x1 : T) (o : OK (phi x0 x1))
  : Iff (C a A (phi x0 x1)) (Or (Cap A a (phi x0 x1)) (C a A x0 * C a A x1)) =
  ca-two a A (phi x0 x1) x0 x1 o (ot-phi0 x0 x1 o) (ot-phi1 x0 x1 o) (cin-phi a A x0 x1) ;

ca-om (a : T) (A : Cl) (x0 : T) (o : OK (om x0))
  : Iff (C a A (om x0)) (Or (Cap A a (om x0)) (C a A x0)) =
  ca-one a A (om x0) x0 o (ot-om0 x0 o) (cin-om a A x0) ;

-- (d), uniformly:  psi_k y in C^a(A) iff in A n a, or (a <' k and k, y in C^a(A))
PsiP (a : T) (A : Cl) (k y : T) : U lv = LT a k * (C a A k * C a A y) ;

-- cin of psi_k y when a <' k, and when not
cin-psi-t (a : T) (A : Cl) (k y : T) (t : LT a k)
  : Iff (cin a A (psi k y)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y)) =
  (\ h -> fw (psiC (lt a k) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y))
             (psiC-t (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y) (lt a k) t)
             (fw (cin a A (psi k y)) (psiC (lt a k) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y)) (cin-psi a A k y) h),
   \ h -> bw (cin a A (psi k y)) (psiC (lt a k) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y)) (cin-psi a A k y)
             (bw (psiC (lt a k) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y))
               (psiC-t (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y) (lt a k) t) h)) ;
cin-psi-f (a : T) (A : Cl) (k y : T) (n : Id Bool (lt a k) false)
  : Iff (cin a A (psi k y)) (Cap A a (psi k y)) =
  (\ h -> fw (psiC (lt a k) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y)) (Cap A a (psi k y))
             (psiC-f (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y) (lt a k) n)
             (fw (cin a A (psi k y)) (psiC (lt a k) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y)) (cin-psi a A k y) h),
   \ h -> bw (cin a A (psi k y)) (psiC (lt a k) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y)) (cin-psi a A k y)
             (bw (psiC (lt a k) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y)) (Cap A a (psi k y))
               (psiC-f (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin a A k * cin a A y) (lt a k) n) h)) ;

ca-psi-t (a : T) (A : Cl) (k y : T) (o : OK (psi k y)) (t : LT a k)
  : Iff (C a A (psi k y)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k y)) (PsiP a A k y)) =
  (\ h -> orMap (Cap A a (psi k y)) (C a A k * C a A y) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (PsiP a A k y) (\ p -> p) (\ q -> (t, q))
             (fw (C a A (psi k y)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k y)) (C a A k * C a A y))
               (ca-two a A (psi k y) k y o (ot-psi0 k y o) (ot-psi1 k y o) (cin-psi-t a A k y t)) h),
   \ h -> bw (C a A (psi k y)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k y)) (C a A k * C a A y))
             (ca-two a A (psi k y) k y o (ot-psi0 k y o) (ot-psi1 k y o) (cin-psi-t a A k y t))
             (orMap (Cap A a (psi k y)) (PsiP a A k y) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (C a A k * C a A y) (\ p -> p) (\ q -> q.2) h)) ;

ca-psi-f (a : T) (A : Cl) (k y : T) (o : OK (psi k y)) (n : Id Bool (lt a k) false)
  : Iff (C a A (psi k y)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k y)) (PsiP a A k y)) =
  (\ h -> inl (fw (cin a A (psi k y)) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin-psi-f a A k y n) (ca-in a A (psi k y) h)),
   \ h -> ca-mk a A (psi k y) o (bw (cin a A (psi k y)) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (cin-psi-f a A k y n)
             (either (Cap A a (psi k y)) (PsiP a A k y) (Cap A a (psi k y)) (\ p -> p) (\ q -> abF (trans (sym n) q.1)) h))) ;

ca-psi (a : T) (A : Cl) (k y : T) (o : OK (psi k y))
  : Iff (C a A (psi k y)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k y)) (PsiP a A k y)) =
  boolCases (Iff (C a A (psi k y)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k y)) (PsiP a A k y))) (lt a k)
    (\ t -> ca-psi-t a A k y o t) (\ n -> ca-psi-f a A k y o n) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Definition 4.5, Remark 4.6(b)

-- A = B (Setzer's A ~= B)
Eqv (A B : Cl) : U lv = (x : T) -> Iff (A x) (B x) ;

-- tau^A(a) = C^a(A) n a
tau (A : Cl) (a : T) : Cl = Cap (C a A) a ;
-- M(A) = {y in OT | y in C^y(A)}
M (A : Cl) : Cl = \ y -> OK y * C y A y ;
m-c (A : Cl) (y : T) (h : M A y) : C y A y = h.2 ;
-- A^A(B) = {y in M(A) | tau^A(y) c B}
scA (A B : Cl) : Cl = \ y -> M A y * Sub (tau A y) B ;

rem46b (A B : Cl) (y : T) : (M A y -> OK y) * ((tau A y y -> OK y) * (scA A B y -> M A y)) =
  (\ h -> h.1, (\ h -> ca-ok y A y h.1, \ h -> h.1)) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Cardinals (kappa in R n OT)

-- psi_k y <' k: clause (8) for k = I, clause (6) with pi = k otherwise
psi-lt (k y : T) (o : OK (psi k y)) : LT (psi k y) k =
  boolCases (LT (psi k y) k) (isI k)
    (\ e -> subst (\ s -> LT (psi k y) s) (sym (isI-true k e)) (lt-TI k y e))
    (\ n -> let { r : RS k = rs-psi k y o n ; }
            in subst (\ s -> LT (psi k y) s) (sym r.2.1)
                 (trans (lex-SO k y r.1 n)
                    (orIr (lt k (om r.1)) (and (eqT k (om r.1)) true)
                      (andI (eqT k (om r.1)) true
                        (subst (\ s -> Tr (eqT s (om r.1))) (sym r.2.1) (eqT-refl (om r.1))) (refl true))))) ;

-- k = Omega_s with s in OT: I = Omega_I, Omega'_e = Omega_e (e in Suc, so not 0, not in Fi)
r-omF (k : T) (ok : OK k) (hR : Tr (isR k)) : (s : T) * (OK s * Id T (omF s) k) =
  boolCases ((s : T) * (OK s * Id T (omF s) k)) (isI k)
    (\ e -> (ii, (refl true, sym (isI-true k e))))
    (\ n -> let { r : RS k = r-split k ok hR n ; }
            in (r.1, (ot-om0 r.1 r.2.2.1, trans (omF-mov r.1 (suc-fx r.1 r.2.2.2)) (sym r.2.1)))) ;

-- k <=' a => k <=' a~  (card-M, the proof of Remark 2.14(b))
r-tilde (k a : T) (ok : OK k) (hR : Tr (isR k)) (oa : OK a) (h : Tr (le k a)) : Tr (le k (tilde a)) =
  let { s : (s : T) * (OK s * Id T (omF s) k) = r-omF k ok hR ; }
  in subst (\ q -> Tr (le q (tilde a))) s.2.2
       (card-M a oa s.1 s.2.1 (subst (\ q -> Tr (le q a)) (sym s.2.2) h)) ;

-- Omega_1 <' I, a closed computation (clauses (10) and (4))
om1-lt-I : LT (om one) ii = refl true ;
om1-OK : OK (om one) = refl true ;

-- Omega_1 <=' k
r-om1 (k : T) (ok : OK k) (hR : Tr (isR k)) : Tr (le (om one) k) =
  boolCases (Tr (le (om one) k)) (isI k)
    (\ e -> subst (\ s -> Tr (le (om one) s)) (sym (isI-true k e)) (le-of-lt (om one) ii om1-lt-I))
    (\ n -> let { r : RS k = r-split k ok hR n ; }
            in subst (\ s -> Tr (le (om one) s)) (sym r.2.1)
                 (om-mono one r.1 (one-le r.1 (ot-T r.1 (ot-om0 r.1 r.2.2.1)) (not-true (isZero r.1) (suc-nz r.1 r.2.2.2))))) ;

-- a~ <=' a  (Remark 2.14(f))
til-le (a : T) (oa : OK a) : Tr (le (tilde a) a) = (rem214f a oa).2.2.2.2.1 ;
til-OK (a : T) (oa : OK a) : OK (tilde a) = (rem214a a oa).1 ;

-- a~ <=' b <' k gives a <' k
lt-of-tilde (a b k : T) (oa : OK a) (ob : OK b) (ok : OK k) (hR : Tr (isR k))
  (hab : Tr (le (tilde a) b)) (p : LT b k) : LT a k =
  boolCases (LT a k) (lt a k) (\ t -> t)
    (\ f -> abF (trans (sym (lt-irr k))
             (le-lt k b k (trOT k b k ok ob ok)
               (le-trans k (tilde a) b (trOT k (tilde a) b ok (til-OK a oa) ob)
                 (r-tilde k a ok hR oa (nlt-le k a (ot-T k ok) (ot-T a oa) f)) hab) p))) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.7 (h), (d)

rem47h (a : T) (A : Cl) : (x : T) -> OK x -> Cap A a x -> C a A x = split {
  zero -> \ o h -> ca-zero a A ;
  plus x0 xs -> \ o h -> bw (C a A (plus x0 xs)) (Or (Cap A a (plus x0 xs)) (C a A x0 * C a A xs)) (ca-plus a A x0 xs o) (inl h) ;
  phi x0 x1 -> \ o h -> bw (C a A (phi x0 x1)) (Or (Cap A a (phi x0 x1)) (C a A x0 * C a A x1)) (ca-phi a A x0 x1 o) (inl h) ;
  psi k y -> \ o h -> bw (C a A (psi k y)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k y)) (PsiP a A k y)) (ca-psi a A k y o) (inl h) ;
  om x0 -> \ o h -> bw (C a A (om x0)) (Or (Cap A a (om x0)) (C a A x0)) (ca-om a A x0 o) (inl h) ;
  ii -> \ o h -> ca-I a A } ;

rem47d (a : T) (A : Cl) (oa : OK a) (h : LT a (om one)) : (x : T) -> OK x -> C a A x = split {
  zero -> \ o -> ca-zero a A ;
  plus x0 xs | r0 rs -> \ o -> bw (C a A (plus x0 xs)) (Or (Cap A a (plus x0 xs)) (C a A x0 * C a A xs)) (ca-plus a A x0 xs o)
    (inr (r0 (ot-plus0 x0 xs o), rs (ot-plusS x0 xs o))) ;
  phi x0 x1 | r0 r1 -> \ o -> bw (C a A (phi x0 x1)) (Or (Cap A a (phi x0 x1)) (C a A x0 * C a A x1)) (ca-phi a A x0 x1 o)
    (inr (r0 (ot-phi0 x0 x1 o), r1 (ot-phi1 x0 x1 o))) ;
  psi k y | rk ry -> \ o -> bw (C a A (psi k y)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k y)) (PsiP a A k y)) (ca-psi a A k y o)
    (inr (lt-le a (om one) k (trOT a (om one) k oa om1-OK (ot-psi0 k y o)) h (r-om1 k (ot-psi0 k y o) (ot-psiR k y o)),
          (rk (ot-psi0 k y o), ry (ot-psi1 k y o)))) ;
  om x0 | r0 -> \ o -> bw (C a A (om x0)) (Or (Cap A a (om x0)) (C a A x0)) (ca-om a A x0 o) (inr (r0 (ot-om0 x0 o))) ;
  ii -> \ o -> ca-I a A } ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.7 (a), (b)

-- Down(x): for a, b in OT with a~ <=' b, x in C^b(A) gives x in C^a(A)
Down (A : Cl) (x : T) : U lv = (a b : T) -> OK a -> OK b -> Tr (le (tilde a) b) -> C b A x -> C a A x ;

-- the case x in A n b of the step: x <' a gives x in A n a; otherwise
-- a <=' x, and x in C^x(A) (A c M(A)) is by P(x), as x <' x is false
down-own (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (x : T) (P : T -> U lv)
  (ch : (c : T) -> OK x -> Iff (C c A x) (Or (Cap A c x) (P c)))
  (ih : (a b : T) -> OK x -> OK a -> OK b -> Tr (le (tilde a) b) -> P b -> P a)
  (a b : T) (oa : OK a) (o : OK x) (own : Cap A b x) : C a A x =
  boolCases (C a A x) (lt x a)
    (\ t -> bw (C a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) (P a)) (ch a o) (inl (own.1, t)))
    (\ f -> either (Cap A x x) (P x) (C a A x)
              (\ q -> abF (trans (sym (lt-irr x)) q.2))
              (\ p -> bw (C a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) (P a)) (ch a o)
                        (inr (ih a x o oa o
                               (le-trans (tilde a) a x (trOT (tilde a) a x (til-OK a oa) oa o) (til-le a oa)
                                 (nlt-le a x (ot-T a oa) (ot-T x o) f)) p)))
              (fw (C x A x) (Or (Cap A x x) (P x)) (ch x o) (m-c A x (hA x own.1)))) ;

-- the step, for x with "x in C^c(A) iff x in A n c or P(c)" for every c,
-- and P(b) => P(a) whenever a~ <=' b
down-step (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (x : T) (P : T -> U lv)
  (ch : (c : T) -> OK x -> Iff (C c A x) (Or (Cap A c x) (P c)))
  (ih : (a b : T) -> OK x -> OK a -> OK b -> Tr (le (tilde a) b) -> P b -> P a) : Down A x =
  \ a b oa ob hab h ->
    let { o : OK x = ca-ok b A x h ; }
    in either (Cap A b x) (P b) (C a A x)
      (\ own -> down-own A hA x P ch ih a b oa o own)
      (\ p -> bw (C a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) (P a)) (ch a o) (inr (ih a b o oa ob hab p)))
      (fw (C b A x) (Or (Cap A b x) (P b)) (ch b o) h) ;

ca-down (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) : (x : T) -> Down A x = split {
  zero -> \ a b oa ob hab h -> ca-zero a A ;
  plus x0 xs | r0 rs -> down-step A hA (plus x0 xs) (\ c -> C c A x0 * C c A xs) (\ c o -> ca-plus c A x0 xs o)
    (\ a b o oa ob hab p -> (r0 a b oa ob hab p.1, rs a b oa ob hab p.2)) ;
  phi x0 x1 | r0 r1 -> down-step A hA (phi x0 x1) (\ c -> C c A x0 * C c A x1) (\ c o -> ca-phi c A x0 x1 o)
    (\ a b o oa ob hab p -> (r0 a b oa ob hab p.1, r1 a b oa ob hab p.2)) ;
  psi k y | rk ry -> down-step A hA (psi k y) (\ c -> PsiP c A k y) (\ c o -> ca-psi c A k y o)
    (\ a b o oa ob hab p -> (lt-of-tilde a b k oa ob (ot-psi0 k y o) (ot-psiR k y o) hab p.1,
                           (rk a b oa ob hab p.2.1, ry a b oa ob hab p.2.2))) ;
  om x0 | r0 -> down-step A hA (om x0) (\ c -> C c A x0) (\ c o -> ca-om c A x0 o) (\ a b o -> r0 a b) ;
  ii -> \ a b oa ob hab h -> ca-I a A } ;

-- (b) A c M(A), a <=' b => C^b(A) c C^a(A)
rem47b (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a b : T) (oa : OK a) (ob : OK b) (h : Tr (le a b)) : Sub (C b A) (C a A) =
  \ x g -> ca-down A hA x a b oa ob (le-trans (tilde a) a b (trOT (tilde a) a b (til-OK a oa) oa ob) (til-le a oa) h) g ;

-- (a) A c M(A) => C^a(A) = C^{a~}(A)
rem47a (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a : T) (oa : OK a) : Eqv (C a A) (C (tilde a) A) =
  \ x -> (\ g -> ca-down A hA x (tilde a) a (til-OK a oa) oa
                   (le-trans (tilde (tilde a)) (tilde a) a
                      (trOT (tilde (tilde a)) (tilde a) a (til-OK (tilde a) (til-OK a oa)) (til-OK a oa) oa)
                      (rem214b (tilde a) a (til-OK a oa) oa (til-le a oa)).1 (til-le a oa)) g,
          \ g -> ca-down A hA x a (tilde a) oa (til-OK a oa) (le-refl (tilde a)) g) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.9 (a)-(d)

-- (a) A c M(A), b <=' a => tau^A(a) n b c tau^A(b)
rem49a (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a b : T) (oa : OK a) (ob : OK b) (h : Tr (le b a)) : Sub (Cap (tau A a) b) (tau A b) =
  \ y g -> (rem47b A hA b a ob oa h y g.1.1, g.2) ;

-- substitution in the superscript
ca-sup (a a' : T) (A : Cl) (y : T) (e : Id T a a') (g : C a A y) : C a' A y = subst (\ s -> C s A y) e g ;

-- C^b(A) c C^a(A) when b~ = a~ (4.7(a) at b and at a)
ca-same (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a b : T) (oa : OK a) (ob : OK b) (e : Id T (tilde b) (tilde a)) : Sub (C b A) (C a A) =
  \ y g -> bw (C a A y) (C (tilde a) A y) (rem47a A hA a oa y)
             (ca-sup (tilde b) (tilde a) A y e (fw (C b A y) (C (tilde b) A y) (rem47a A hA b ob y) g)) ;

-- (b) A c M(A), b <=' a, b~ = a~ => tau^A(b) = tau^A(a) n b
rem49b (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a b : T) (oa : OK a) (ob : OK b) (h : Tr (le b a)) (e : Id T (tilde b) (tilde a))
  : Eqv (tau A b) (Cap (tau A a) b) =
  \ y -> (\ g -> ((ca-same A hA a b oa ob e y g.1, lt-le y b a (trOT y b a (ca-ok b A y g.1) ob oa) g.2 h), g.2),
          \ g -> (ca-same A hA b a ob oa (sym e) y g.1.1, g.2)) ;

-- (c) a <' Omega_1 => tau^A(a) = OT n a
rem49c (A : Cl) (a : T) (oa : OK a) (h : LT a (om one)) : Eqv (tau A a) (\ y -> OK y * LT y a) =
  \ y -> (\ g -> (ca-ok a A y g.1, g.2), \ g -> (rem47d a A oa h y g.1, g.2)) ;

-- (d) 0, I in M(A)
rem49d (A : Cl) : M A zero * M A ii = ((refl true, ca-zero zero A), (refl true, ca-I ii A)) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.7 (c)

-- the step, for x with "x in C^a(A) iff x in A n a or P" and the same for B with Q
mono-step (a : T) (A B : Cl) (x : T) (P Q : U lv)
  (chA : OK x -> Iff (C a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) P)) (chB : OK x -> Iff (C a B x) (Or (Cap B a x) Q))
  (hAB : Sub (Cap A a) (Cap B a)) (f : P -> Q) (h : C a A x) : C a B x =
  bw (C a B x) (Or (Cap B a x) Q) (chB (ca-ok a A x h))
    (orMap (Cap A a x) P (Cap B a x) Q (hAB x) f (fw (C a A x) (Or (Cap A a x) P) (chA (ca-ok a A x h)) h)) ;

-- A n a c B n a => C^a(A) c C^a(B)
ca-mono (a : T) (A B : Cl) (hAB : Sub (Cap A a) (Cap B a)) : (x : T) -> C a A x -> C a B x = split {
  zero -> \ h -> ca-zero a B ;
  plus x0 xs | r0 rs -> mono-step a A B (plus x0 xs) (C a A x0 * C a A xs) (C a B x0 * C a B xs)
    (ca-plus a A x0 xs) (ca-plus a B x0 xs) hAB (\ p -> (r0 p.1, rs p.2)) ;
  phi x0 x1 | r0 r1 -> mono-step a A B (phi x0 x1) (C a A x0 * C a A x1) (C a B x0 * C a B x1)
    (ca-phi a A x0 x1) (ca-phi a B x0 x1) hAB (\ p -> (r0 p.1, r1 p.2)) ;
  psi k y | rk ry -> mono-step a A B (psi k y) (PsiP a A k y) (PsiP a B k y)
    (ca-psi a A k y) (ca-psi a B k y) hAB (\ p -> (p.1, (rk p.2.1, ry p.2.2))) ;
  om x0 | r0 -> mono-step a A B (om x0) (C a A x0) (C a B x0) (ca-om a A x0) (ca-om a B x0) hAB r0 ;
  ii -> \ h -> ca-I a B } ;

-- one direction of (c), from A n a~ c B n a~
c-via (A B : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (hB : Sub B (M B)) (a : T) (oa : OK a)
  (h : Sub (Cap A (tilde a)) (Cap B (tilde a))) : Sub (C a A) (C a B) =
  \ x g -> bw (C a B x) (C (tilde a) B x) (rem47a B hB a oa x)
             (ca-mono (tilde a) A B h x (fw (C a A x) (C (tilde a) A x) (rem47a A hA a oa x) g)) ;

-- (c) A c M(A), B c M(B), A n a~ = B n a~ => C^a(A) = C^a(B)
rem47c (A B : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (hB : Sub B (M B)) (a : T) (oa : OK a)
  (e : Eqv (Cap A (tilde a)) (Cap B (tilde a))) : Eqv (C a A) (C a B) =
  \ x -> (c-via A B hA hB a oa (\ y -> fw (Cap A (tilde a) y) (Cap B (tilde a) y) (e y)) x,
          c-via B A hB hA a oa (\ y -> bw (Cap A (tilde a) y) (Cap B (tilde a) y) (e y)) x) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- More on cardinals

-- Omega_s <' Omega'_e = Omega_e  =>  s <' e  (2.12(g))
km-se (e s : T) (oe : OK (om e)) (hs : Tr (isSuc e)) (os : OK s) (h : LT (omF s) (om e)) : LT s e =
  trans (sym (rem212g s e (ot-T s os) (ot-T e (ot-om0 e oe))))
    (subst (\ u -> LT (omF s) u) (sym (omF-mov e (suc-fx e hs))) h) ;

-- Omega_s <' Omega'_e  =>  Omega_s <=' kappa^-  (by definition kappa^- = Omega_{pred1 e}, and
-- Omega_0 = 0: s <=' pred1 e by lt-succ; e = 1 forces s = 0)
card-km (e s : T) (oe : OK (om e)) (hs : Tr (isSuc e)) (os : OK s) (h : LT (omF s) (om e))
  : Tr (le (omF s) (kminus (om e))) =
  boolCases (Tr (le (omF s) (kminus (om e)))) (isZero s)
    (\ hz -> subst (\ u -> Tr (le (omF u) (kminus (om e)))) (sym (isZero-true s hz)) (zero-le-any (kminus (om e))))
    (\ hz -> boolCases (Tr (le (omF s) (kminus (om e)))) (isOne e)
       (\ ho -> abF (trans (sym (one-min s (ot-T s os) hz))
                   (subst (\ u -> LT s u) (one-eq e ho) (km-se e s oe hs os h))))
       (\ ho -> omF-le-mono s (pred1 e) (ot-T s os) (pred-lt e (ot-T e (ot-om0 e oe)) hs ho).2.1
                  (lt-succ e (ot-T e (ot-om0 e oe)) hs ho s (ot-T s os) (km-se e s oe hs os h)))) ;

-- a <' Omega'_e  =>  a~ <' psi_{Omega'_e} d:  a~ = Omega_s <=' a <' Omega'_e (2.14(f)), so
-- a~ <=' kappa^- <' psi_kappa d (card-km, km-lt)
til-psi-om (a e d : T) (oa : OK a) (oe : OK (om e)) (hs : Tr (isSuc e)) (o : OK (psi (om e) d)) (h : LT a (om e))
  : LT (tilde a) (psi (om e) d) =
  let { f : (s : T) * (OK s * (Id T (tilde a) (omF s) * (Id T (up a) (omF (suc s)) * (Tr (le (tilde a) a) * LT a (up a)))))
          = rem214f a oa ; }
  in subst (\ t -> LT t (psi (om e) d)) (sym f.2.2.1)
       (le-lt (omF f.1) (kminus (om e)) (psi (om e) d)
          (tr3 (omF f.1) (kminus (om e)) (psi (om e) d) (ot-T (omF f.1) (omF-OK f.1 f.2.1))
             (km-T e (ot-T e (ot-om0 e oe)) hs) (ot-T (psi (om e) d) o))
          (card-km e f.1 oe hs f.2.1
             (subst (\ t -> LT t (om e)) f.2.2.1
                (le-lt (tilde a) a (om e) (trOT (tilde a) a (om e) (til-OK a oa) oa oe) (til-le a oa) h)))
          ((km-lt e (ot-T e (ot-om0 e oe)) hs).2 d)) ;

-- a <' kappa /= I  =>  a~ <' psi_kappa d
til-psi (a k d : T) (oa : OK a) (o : OK (psi k d)) (hk : Id Bool (isI k) false) (h : LT a k) : LT (tilde a) (psi k d) =
  let { r : RS k = rs-psi k d o hk ; }
  in subst (\ q -> OK (psi q d) -> LT a q -> LT (tilde a) (psi q d)) (sym r.2.1)
       (\ o' h' -> til-psi-om a r.1 d oa r.2.2.1 r.2.2.2 o' h') o h ;

-- b~ <' I  =>  b <' I   (I <=' b would give I <=' b~, r-tilde)
til-I (b : T) (ob : OK b) (h : LT (tilde b) ii) : LT b ii =
  boolCases (LT b ii) (lt b ii) (\ t -> t)
    (\ f -> abF (trans (sym (le-nlt ii (tilde b) (refl true) (ot-T (tilde b) (til-OK b ob))
                          (r-tilde ii b (refl true) (refl true) ob (nlt-le ii b (refl true) (ot-T b ob) f)))) h)) ;

-- b^{-I} = c^{-I}, b <' I  =>  c <' I   (by definition of mI)
mI-lt (b c : T) (e : Id T (mI b) (mI c)) (h : LT b ii) : LT c ii =
  boolCases (LT c ii) (lt c ii) (\ t -> t)
    (\ f -> abT (ap isZero (trans (sym (ifT-t (lt b ii) zero ii h)) (trans e (ifT-f (lt c ii) zero ii f))))) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.7 (e)
--
-- b, c with psi_I a <=' b, c <' I (Mid).  E(u): u in C_I(a) n C^b(A) => u in C^c(A),
-- by induction on u; then swap b and c.
--   own clause: u <' b <' I gives u <' psi_I a (2.15(c) at I), so u <' c  (e-move).
--   +, phi, Omega: the parts are in C_I(a) (2.15(b)), induction.
--   psi_k y (G_I(psi_k y) by definition of G, gPsi):  k <' I: G_I = G_I(k), so k in
--   C_I(a), k <' psi_I a <=' b, and b <' k is false: own clause only.  I <=' k: G_I is
--   {y} u G_I(k) u G_I(y), so k, y in C_I(a); c <' I <=' k; induction.

-- G_I(psi_k y), by definition of G and gPsi (p = I): G_I(k) if k <' I, the full set if I <=' k
g-psi-lo (k y : T) (n : Id Bool (isI k) false) (l : Id Bool (le ii k) false) : Id L (G ii (psi k y)) (G ii k) =
  trans (ifL-f (isI k) (cons y (app (G ii k) (G ii y))) (ifL (le ii k) (cons y (app (G ii k) (G ii y))) (G ii k)) n)
        (ifL-f (le ii k) (cons y (app (G ii k) (G ii y))) (G ii k) l) ;
g-psi-hi (k y : T) (l : Tr (le ii k)) : Id L (G ii (psi k y)) (cons y (app (G ii k) (G ii y))) =
  boolCases (Id L (G ii (psi k y)) (cons y (app (G ii k) (G ii y)))) (isI k)
    (\ t -> ifL-t (isI k) (cons y (app (G ii k) (G ii y))) (ifL (le ii k) (cons y (app (G ii k) (G ii y))) (G ii k)) t)
    (\ n -> trans (ifL-f (isI k) (cons y (app (G ii k) (G ii y))) (ifL (le ii k) (cons y (app (G ii k) (G ii y))) (G ii k)) n)
                  (ifL-t (le ii k) (cons y (app (G ii k) (G ii y))) (G ii k) l)) ;

-- psi_k y in C_I(a), k <' I:  k in C_I(a)
inc-psi-lo (a k y : T) (o : OK (psi k y)) (l : Id Bool (le ii k) false) (hu : InC ii a (psi k y)) : InC ii a k =
  boolCases (InC ii a k) (isI k)
    (\ t -> abF (trans (sym l) (subst (\ q -> Tr (le ii q)) (sym (isI-true k t)) (le-refl ii))))
    (\ n -> trans (inC-T ii a k (ot-T k (ot-psi0 k y o)))
              (trans (ap (\ M -> allLt M a) (sym (g-psi-lo k y n l)))
                 (trans (sym (inC-T ii a (psi k y) (ot-T (psi k y) o))) hu))) ;

-- the parts of the second disjunct of 2.15(d)
x5-parts (a k y : T) (h : Tr (X5 ii a k y)) : InC ii a k * InC ii a y =
  (and-l (inC ii a k) (inC ii a y) (and-l (and (inC ii a k) (inC ii a y)) (lt y a) h),
   and-r (inC ii a k) (inC ii a y) (and-l (and (inC ii a k) (inC ii a y)) (lt y a) h)) ;

-- psi_k y in C_I(a), I <=' k:  k, y in C_I(a)
inc-psi-hi (a k y : T) (o : OK (psi k y)) (l : Tr (le ii k)) (hu : InC ii a (psi k y)) : InC ii a k * InC ii a y =
  x5-parts a k y
    (trans (sym (full-eq ii a k y (ot-T k (ot-psi0 k y o)) (ot-T y (ot-psi1 k y o))))
       (trans (ap (\ M -> allLt M a) (sym (g-psi-hi k y l)))
          (trans (sym (inC-T ii a (psi k y) (ot-T (psi k y) o))) hu))) ;

-- the parts of a sum, phi, Omega in C_I(a) (2.15(b))
inc-plus (a x0 xs : T) (o : OK (plus x0 xs)) (hu : InC ii a (plus x0 xs)) : InC ii a x0 * InC ii a xs =
  (and-l (inC ii a x0) (inC ii a xs) (trans (sym (rem215b-plus ii a x0 xs (ot-T (plus x0 xs) o))) hu),
   and-r (inC ii a x0) (inC ii a xs) (trans (sym (rem215b-plus ii a x0 xs (ot-T (plus x0 xs) o))) hu)) ;
inc-phi (a x0 x1 : T) (o : OK (phi x0 x1)) (hu : InC ii a (phi x0 x1)) : InC ii a x0 * InC ii a x1 =
  (and-l (inC ii a x0) (inC ii a x1) (trans (sym (rem215b-phi ii a x0 x1 (ot-T (phi x0 x1) o))) hu),
   and-r (inC ii a x0) (inC ii a x1) (trans (sym (rem215b-phi ii a x0 x1 (ot-T (phi x0 x1) o))) hu)) ;
inc-om (a x0 : T) (o : OK (om x0)) (hu : InC ii a (om x0)) : InC ii a x0 =
  trans (sym (rem215b-om ii a x0 (ot-T (om x0) o))) hu ;

-- psi_I a <=' b <' I  (b in OT)
Mid (a b : T) : U lv = OK b * (Tr (le (psi ii a) b) * LT b ii) ;

-- u in C_I(a), u <' I  =>  u <' psi_I a  (2.15(c) at I)
inc-below (a u : T) (ta : TT a) (ou : OK u) (hu : InC ii a u) (h : LT u ii) : LT u (psi ii a) =
  trans (sym (cs-I u a ta ou h)) hu ;

-- u in C_I(a), u <' b  =>  u <' c   (u <' b <' I, so u <' psi_I a <=' c)
e-move (a b c u : T) (ta : TT a) (mb : Mid a b) (mc : Mid a c) (ou : OK u) (hu : InC ii a u) (h : LT u b) : LT u c =
  lt-le u (psi ii a) c (tr3 u (psi ii a) c (ot-T u ou) (tt-psik ii a (refl true) (refl true) ta) (ot-T c mc.1))
    (inc-below a u ta ou hu (tr3 u b ii (ot-T u ou) (ot-T b mb.1) (refl true) h mb.2.2)) mc.2.1 ;

-- E(u): u in C_I(a) n C^b(A) => u in C^c(A), for b, c with psi_I a <=' b, c <' I
E47 (a : T) (A : Cl) (u : T) : U lv = (b c : T) -> Mid a b -> Mid a c -> OK u -> InC ii a u -> C b A u -> C c A u ;

-- the step, for u with "u in C^c(A) iff u in A n c or P(c)": the own clause by e-move
e-step (a : T) (ta : TT a) (A : Cl) (u : T) (P : T -> U lv)
  (ch : (c : T) -> OK u -> Iff (C c A u) (Or (Cap A c u) (P c)))
  (ih : (b c : T) -> Mid a b -> Mid a c -> OK u -> InC ii a u -> P b -> P c) : E47 a A u =
  \ b c mb mc o hu h ->
    bw (C c A u) (Or (Cap A c u) (P c)) (ch c o)
      (orMap (Cap A b u) (P b) (Cap A c u) (P c) (\ q -> (q.1, e-move a b c u ta mb mc o hu q.2)) (ih b c mb mc o hu)
         (fw (C b A u) (Or (Cap A b u) (P b)) (ch b o) h)) ;

-- psi_k y:  k <' I gives k in C_I(a), so k <' psi_I a <=' b, and b <' k is false;
-- I <=' k gives k, y in C_I(a) and c <' I <=' k
e-psi (a : T) (ta : TT a) (A : Cl) (k y : T) (rk : E47 a A k) (ry : E47 a A y)
  (b c : T) (mb : Mid a b) (mc : Mid a c) (o : OK (psi k y)) (hu : InC ii a (psi k y)) (p : PsiP b A k y) : PsiP c A k y =
  boolCases (PsiP c A k y) (le ii k)
    (\ l -> (lt-le c ii k (trOT c ii k mc.1 (refl true) (ot-psi0 k y o)) mc.2.2 l,
             (rk b c mb mc (ot-psi0 k y o) (inc-psi-hi a k y o l hu).1 p.2.1,
              ry b c mb mc (ot-psi1 k y o) (inc-psi-hi a k y o l hu).2 p.2.2)))
    (\ l -> abF (trans (sym (lt-asym k b (ot-T k (ot-psi0 k y o)) (ot-T b mb.1)
                   (lt-le k (psi ii a) b (tr3 k (psi ii a) b (ot-T k (ot-psi0 k y o)) (tt-psik ii a (refl true) (refl true) ta) (ot-T b mb.1))
                      (inc-below a k ta (ot-psi0 k y o) (inc-psi-lo a k y o l hu)
                         (nle-lt' ii k (refl true) (ot-T k (ot-psi0 k y o)) l))
                      mb.2.1)))
                 p.1)) ;

ca-e (a : T) (ta : TT a) (A : Cl) : (u : T) -> E47 a A u = split {
  zero -> \ b c mb mc o hu h -> ca-zero c A ;
  plus x0 xs | r0 rs -> e-step a ta A (plus x0 xs) (\ c -> C c A x0 * C c A xs) (\ c o -> ca-plus c A x0 xs o)
    (\ b c mb mc o hu p -> (r0 b c mb mc (ot-plus0 x0 xs o) (inc-plus a x0 xs o hu).1 p.1,
                          rs b c mb mc (ot-plusS x0 xs o) (inc-plus a x0 xs o hu).2 p.2)) ;
  phi x0 x1 | r0 r1 -> e-step a ta A (phi x0 x1) (\ c -> C c A x0 * C c A x1) (\ c o -> ca-phi c A x0 x1 o)
    (\ b c mb mc o hu p -> (r0 b c mb mc (ot-phi0 x0 x1 o) (inc-phi a x0 x1 o hu).1 p.1,
                          r1 b c mb mc (ot-phi1 x0 x1 o) (inc-phi a x0 x1 o hu).2 p.2)) ;
  psi k y | rk ry -> e-step a ta A (psi k y) (\ c -> PsiP c A k y) (\ c o -> ca-psi c A k y o) (e-psi a ta A k y rk ry) ;
  om x0 | r0 -> e-step a ta A (om x0) (\ c -> C c A x0) (\ c o -> ca-om c A x0 o)
    (\ b c mb mc o hu p -> r0 b c mb mc (ot-om0 x0 o) (inc-om a x0 o hu) p) ;
  ii -> \ b c mb mc o hu h -> ca-I c A } ;

-- (e) psi_I a <=' b <' I, psi_I a <=' c <' I => C^b(A) n C_I(a) = C^c(A) n C_I(a)
rem47e (A : Cl) (a : T) (ta : TT a) (b c : T) (mb : Mid a b) (mc : Mid a c) (u : T) (o : OK u) (hu : InC ii a u)
  : Iff (C b A u) (C c A u) =
  (ca-e a ta A u b c mb mc o hu, ca-e a ta A u c b mc mb o hu) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.7 (f)
--
-- Three cases.  a <' d: z = a; d <' a and d <' a~ are false; 4.4(d) at a.
-- a~ <=' d <=' a: z = d; C^a(A) = C^d(A) (4.7(b), Down at (a, d)); d in C^d(A) is not by
-- d <' d, and d <' kappa; d <' a~ is false.  d <' a~: kappa = I (otherwise
-- a~ <' psi_kappa c = d, til-psi); z = d; d in A n a iff d in A n a~; I is in both;
-- c in C^a(A) iff c in C^d(A) by (e) at c (psi_I c <=' a, d <' I; c in C_I(c) by (OT4)).

-- min{a, d}
minT (a d : T) : T = ifT (lt a d) a d ;
-- by definition of minT
min-l (a d : T) (h : LT a d) : Id T (minT a d) a = ifT-t (lt a d) a d h ;
min-r (a d : T) (h : Id Bool (lt a d) false) : Id T (minT a d) d = ifT-f (lt a d) a d h ;

-- the right-hand side of (f), at z
RF (A : Cl) (a z k c : T) : U lv = Or (Cap A (tilde a) (psi k c)) (C z A k * C z A c) ;

-- x <' y and y <' x;  x <=' y and y <' x  (named, with explicit arguments: an implicit
-- match next to a hypothesis "_ in C^a(A)" opens C)
lt-abs (R : U lv) (x y : T) (tx : TT x) (ty : TT y) (h : LT x y) (q : LT y x) : R =
  abF (trans (sym (lt-asym x y tx ty h)) q) ;
le-abs (R : U lv) (x y : T) (tx : TT x) (ty : TT y) (h : Tr (le x y)) (q : LT y x) : R =
  abF (trans (sym (le-nlt x y tx ty h)) q) ;
irr-abs (R : U lv) (x : T) (q : LT x x) : R = abF (trans (sym (lt-irr x)) q) ;

-- a <' d (z = a):  neither d <' a nor d <' a~;  by 4.4(d) at a, with a <' k
f-above (A : Cl) (a k c : T) (oa : OK a) (o : OK (psi k c)) (h : LT a k) (hd : LT a (psi k c))
  : Iff (C a A (psi k c)) (RF A a a k c) =
  (\ g -> either (Cap A a (psi k c)) (PsiP a A k c) (RF A a a k c)
            (\ q -> lt-abs (RF A a a k c) a (psi k c) (ot-T a oa) (ot-T (psi k c) o) hd q.2)
            (\ p -> inr p.2)
            (fw (C a A (psi k c)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k c)) (PsiP a A k c)) (ca-psi a A k c o) g),
   \ g -> bw (C a A (psi k c)) (Or (Cap A a (psi k c)) (PsiP a A k c)) (ca-psi a A k c o)
            (either (Cap A (tilde a) (psi k c)) (C a A k * C a A c) (Or (Cap A a (psi k c)) (PsiP a A k c))
               (\ q -> lt-abs (Or (Cap A a (psi k c)) (PsiP a A k c)) a (psi k c) (ot-T a oa) (ot-T (psi k c) o) hd
                          (lt-le (psi k c) (tilde a) a (trOT (psi k c) (tilde a) a o (til-OK a oa) oa) q.2 (til-le a oa)))
               (\ p -> inr (h, p)) g)) ;

-- a~ <=' d <=' a (z = d):  C^a(A) = C^d(A) (4.7(b), and Down at (a, d));  d in C^d(A) is not
-- by d <' d, and d <' k (psi-lt);  d <' a~ is false
f-mid (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a k c : T) (oa : OK a) (o : OK (psi k c))
  (hda : Tr (le (psi k c) a)) (hl : Tr (le (tilde a) (psi k c)))
  : Iff (C a A (psi k c)) (RF A a (psi k c) k c) =
  (\ g -> either (Cap A (psi k c) (psi k c)) (PsiP (psi k c) A k c) (RF A a (psi k c) k c)
            (\ q -> irr-abs (RF A a (psi k c) k c) (psi k c) q.2)
            (\ p -> inr p.2)
            (fw (C (psi k c) A (psi k c)) (Or (Cap A (psi k c) (psi k c)) (PsiP (psi k c) A k c)) (ca-psi (psi k c) A k c o)
               (rem47b A hA (psi k c) a o oa hda (psi k c) g)),
   \ g -> ca-down A hA (psi k c) a (psi k c) oa o hl
            (bw (C (psi k c) A (psi k c)) (Or (Cap A (psi k c) (psi k c)) (PsiP (psi k c) A k c)) (ca-psi (psi k c) A k c o)
               (either (Cap A (tilde a) (psi k c)) (C (psi k c) A k * C (psi k c) A c) (Or (Cap A (psi k c) (psi k c)) (PsiP (psi k c) A k c))
                  (\ q -> le-abs (Or (Cap A (psi k c) (psi k c)) (PsiP (psi k c) A k c)) (tilde a) (psi k c)
                             (ot-T (tilde a) (til-OK a oa)) (ot-T (psi k c) o) hl q.2)
                  (\ p -> inr (psi-lt k c o, p)) g))) ;

-- c in C_I(c) when psi_I c in OT (OT4)
inc-self (c : T) (o : OK (psi ii c)) : InC ii c c = andI (isT c) (allLt (G ii c) c) (ot-T c (ot-psi1 ii c o)) (ot-psiG ii c o) ;

-- d = psi_I c <' a~, a <' I (z = d):  d in A n a iff d in A n a~;  I is in both;
-- c in C^a(A) iff c in C^d(A) by (e) (psi_I c <=' a, d <' I; c in C_I(c))
f-low-I (A : Cl) (a c : T) (oa : OK a) (o : OK (psi ii c)) (h : LT a ii) (hd : LT (psi ii c) (tilde a))
  : Iff (C a A (psi ii c)) (RF A a (psi ii c) ii c) =
  let { e : Iff (C a A c) (C (psi ii c) A c) =
          rem47e A c (ot-T c (ot-psi1 ii c o)) a (psi ii c)
            (oa, (le-of-lt (psi ii c) a (lt-le (psi ii c) (tilde a) a (trOT (psi ii c) (tilde a) a o (til-OK a oa) oa) hd (til-le a oa)), h))
            (o, (le-refl (psi ii c), psi-lt ii c o))
            c (ot-psi1 ii c o) (inc-self c o) ; }
  in (\ g -> either (Cap A a (psi ii c)) (PsiP a A ii c) (RF A a (psi ii c) ii c)
               (\ q -> inl (q.1, hd))
               (\ p -> inr (ca-I (psi ii c) A, fw (C a A c) (C (psi ii c) A c) e p.2.2))
               (fw (C a A (psi ii c)) (Or (Cap A a (psi ii c)) (PsiP a A ii c)) (ca-psi a A ii c o) g),
      \ g -> bw (C a A (psi ii c)) (Or (Cap A a (psi ii c)) (PsiP a A ii c)) (ca-psi a A ii c o)
               (orMap (Cap A (tilde a) (psi ii c)) (C (psi ii c) A ii * C (psi ii c) A c) (Cap A a (psi ii c)) (PsiP a A ii c)
                  (\ q -> (q.1, lt-le (psi ii c) (tilde a) a (trOT (psi ii c) (tilde a) a o (til-OK a oa) oa) q.2 (til-le a oa)))
                  (\ p -> (h, (ca-I a A, bw (C a A c) (C (psi ii c) A c) e p.2))) g)) ;

-- d <' a~ forces k = I (else a~ <' psi_k c = d, til-psi)
f-low (A : Cl) (a k c : T) (oa : OK a) (o : OK (psi k c)) (h : LT a k) (hd : LT (psi k c) (tilde a))
  : Iff (C a A (psi k c)) (RF A a (psi k c) k c) =
  boolCases (Iff (C a A (psi k c)) (RF A a (psi k c) k c)) (isI k)
    (\ t -> subst (\ q -> OK (psi q c) -> LT a q -> LT (psi q c) (tilde a) -> Iff (C a A (psi q c)) (RF A a (psi q c) q c))
              (sym (isI-true k t)) (\ o' h' hd' -> f-low-I A a c oa o' h' hd') o h hd)
    (\ n -> lt-abs (Iff (C a A (psi k c)) (RF A a (psi k c) k c)) (tilde a) (psi k c) (ot-T (tilde a) (til-OK a oa)) (ot-T (psi k c) o)
               (til-psi a k c oa o n h) hd) ;

-- (f) A c M(A), a <' k, d = psi_k c in OT, z = min{a, d}:
--     d in C^a(A) iff d in A n a~ or k, c in C^z(A)
rem47f (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a k c : T) (oa : OK a) (o : OK (psi k c)) (h : LT a k)
  : Iff (C a A (psi k c)) (RF A a (minT a (psi k c)) k c) =
  boolCases (Iff (C a A (psi k c)) (RF A a (minT a (psi k c)) k c)) (lt a (psi k c))
    (\ t -> subst (\ z -> Iff (C a A (psi k c)) (RF A a z k c)) (sym (min-l a (psi k c) t)) (f-above A a k c oa o h t))
    (\ n -> subst (\ z -> Iff (C a A (psi k c)) (RF A a z k c)) (sym (min-r a (psi k c) n))
       (boolCases (Iff (C a A (psi k c)) (RF A a (psi k c) k c)) (lt (psi k c) (tilde a))
          (\ t' -> f-low A a k c oa o h t')
          (\ n' -> f-mid A hA a k c oa o (nlt-le (psi k c) a (ot-T (psi k c) o) (ot-T a oa) n)
                     (nlt-le (tilde a) (psi k c) (ot-T (tilde a) (til-OK a oa)) (ot-T (psi k c) o) n')))) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.7 (g)
--
-- Throughout: A c M(A), b, c in OT, b~ <=' c, b^{-I} = c^{-I}.
-- Step 1 (g1): x <' b~, x in C^b(A) => x in C^c(A), by induction on x.  The own clause:
-- x <' b~ <=' c.  +, phi, Omega: the parts are <' x (lt-head, sum-lt, phi-below,
-- lt-om), induction.  psi_k y with b <' k: k = I (else b~ <' psi_k y, til-psi), so
-- b <' I and c <' I (mI-lt), and y in C^b(A) iff y in C^c(A) by (e) (psi_I y <=' b, c;
-- y in C_I(y)).
-- Step 2 (g2): b~ in C^b(A) => b~ in C^c(A).  b~ in C^{b~}(A) (4.7(a)), not by its own
-- clause; b~ = Omega_s (2.14(f)): 0, I: 4.4(b).  Omega'_s: s in C^{b~} = C^b, s <' b~,
-- step 1.  psi_I e: b~ <' I, so b, c <' I (til-I, mI-lt), and e in C^{b~} gives e in
-- C^c by (e).
-- Step 3: x <' b~+1 gives x <=' b~ (lt-suc-le').  The converse inclusion holds for all
-- x: C^c(A) c C^{b~}(A) = C^b(A) by (b) and (a).

-- the hypotheses of (g)
GH (b c : T) : U lv = OK b * (OK c * (Tr (le (tilde b) c) * Id T (mI b) (mI c))) ;

-- x <' b~ gives x <' c
g-c (b c x : T) (gh : GH b c) (ox : OK x) (hx : LT x (tilde b)) : LT x c =
  lt-le x (tilde b) c (trOT x (tilde b) c ox (til-OK b gh.1) gh.2.1) hx gh.2.2.1 ;

-- y <' x <' b~ gives y <' b~
g-below (b y x : T) (ob : OK b) (oy : OK y) (ox : OK x) (h : LT y x) (hx : LT x (tilde b)) : LT y (tilde b) =
  tr3 y x (tilde b) (ot-T y oy) (ot-T x ox) (ot-T (tilde b) (til-OK b ob)) h hx ;

G1 (A : Cl) (b c x : T) : U lv = OK x -> LT x (tilde b) -> C b A x -> C c A x ;

-- the step, for x with "x in C^c(A) iff x in A n c or P(c)"
g-step (A : Cl) (b c x : T) (gh : GH b c) (P : T -> U lv)
  (ch : (c : T) -> OK x -> Iff (C c A x) (Or (Cap A c x) (P c)))
  (ih : OK x -> LT x (tilde b) -> P b -> P c) : G1 A b c x =
  \ o hx h -> bw (C c A x) (Or (Cap A c x) (P c)) (ch c o)
     (orMap (Cap A b x) (P b) (Cap A c x) (P c) (\ q -> (q.1, g-c b c x gh o hx)) (ih o hx)
        (fw (C b A x) (Or (Cap A b x) (P b)) (ch b o) h)) ;

-- psi_I y <' b~, b <' I:  y in C^b(A) => y in C^c(A)  (by (e))
g1-psiI (A : Cl) (b c y : T) (gh : GH b c) (o : OK (psi ii y)) (hx : LT (psi ii y) (tilde b))
  (p : PsiP b A ii y) : PsiP c A ii y =
  (mI-lt b c gh.2.2.2 p.1,
   (ca-I c A,
    fw (C b A y) (C c A y)
      (rem47e A y (ot-T y (ot-psi1 ii y o)) b c
         (gh.1, (le-of-lt (psi ii y) b (lt-le (psi ii y) (tilde b) b (trOT (psi ii y) (tilde b) b o (til-OK b gh.1) gh.1) hx (til-le b gh.1)), p.1))
         (gh.2.1, (le-of-lt (psi ii y) c (g-c b c (psi ii y) gh o hx), mI-lt b c gh.2.2.2 p.1))
         y (ot-psi1 ii y o) (inc-self y o))
      p.2.2)) ;

g1-psi (A : Cl) (b c k y : T) (gh : GH b c) (o : OK (psi k y)) (hx : LT (psi k y) (tilde b)) (p : PsiP b A k y) : PsiP c A k y =
  boolCases (PsiP c A k y) (isI k)
    (\ t -> subst (\ q -> OK (psi q y) -> LT (psi q y) (tilde b) -> PsiP b A q y -> PsiP c A q y) (sym (isI-true k t))
              (\ o' hx' p' -> g1-psiI A b c y gh o' hx' p') o hx p)
    (\ n -> lt-abs (PsiP c A k y) (tilde b) (psi k y) (ot-T (tilde b) (til-OK b gh.1)) (ot-T (psi k y) o)
              (til-psi b k y gh.1 o n p.1) hx) ;

g1 (A : Cl) (b c : T) (gh : GH b c) : (x : T) -> G1 A b c x = split {
  zero -> \ o hx h -> ca-zero c A ;
  plus x0 xs | r0 rs -> g-step A b c (plus x0 xs) gh (\ c -> C c A x0 * C c A xs) (\ c o -> ca-plus c A x0 xs o)
    (\ o hx p -> (r0 (ot-plus0 x0 xs o) (g-below b x0 (plus x0 xs) gh.1 (ot-plus0 x0 xs o) o (lt-head x0 xs (ot-plusA x0 xs o)) hx) p.1,
                  rs (ot-plusS x0 xs o) (g-below b xs (plus x0 xs) gh.1 (ot-plusS x0 xs o) o (sum-lt xs x0 o) hx) p.2)) ;
  phi x0 x1 | r0 r1 -> g-step A b c (phi x0 x1) gh (\ c -> C c A x0 * C c A x1) (\ c o -> ca-phi c A x0 x1 o)
    (\ o hx p -> (r0 (ot-phi0 x0 x1 o)
                    (g-below b x0 (phi x0 x1) gh.1 (ot-phi0 x0 x1 o) o
                       ((phi-below x0).1 x0 x1 (ot-T x0 (ot-phi0 x0 x1 o)) (ot-T x0 (ot-phi0 x0 x1 o)) (ot-T x1 (ot-phi1 x0 x1 o)) (le-refl x0)) hx) p.1,
                  r1 (ot-phi1 x0 x1 o)
                    (g-below b x1 (phi x0 x1) gh.1 (ot-phi1 x0 x1 o) o
                       ((phi-below x1).2 x0 x1 (ot-T x1 (ot-phi1 x0 x1 o)) (ot-T x0 (ot-phi0 x0 x1 o)) (ot-T x1 (ot-phi1 x0 x1 o)) (le-refl x1)) hx) p.2)) ;
  psi k y -> g-step A b c (psi k y) gh (\ c -> PsiP c A k y) (\ c o -> ca-psi c A k y o)
    (\ o hx p -> g1-psi A b c k y gh o hx p) ;
  om x0 | r0 -> g-step A b c (om x0) gh (\ c -> C c A x0) (\ c o -> ca-om c A x0 o)
    (\ o hx p -> r0 (ot-om0 x0 o) (g-below b x0 (om x0) gh.1 (ot-om0 x0 o) o (lt-om x0 (ot-om0 x0 o)) hx) p) ;
  ii -> \ o hx h -> ca-I c A } ;

-- substitution in the element (as ca-sup in the superscript)
ca-el (a : T) (A : Cl) (y y' : T) (e : Id T y y') (g : C a A y) : C a A y' = subst (\ s -> C a A s) e g ;
-- the same along e read backwards
ca-sup-r (a a' : T) (A : Cl) (y : T) (e : Id T a' a) (g : C a A y) : C a' A y = subst (\ s -> C s A y) (sym e) g ;
ca-el-r (a : T) (A : Cl) (y y' : T) (e : Id T y' y) (g : C a A y) : C a A y' = subst (\ s -> C a A s) (sym e) g ;

-- facts at t = b~ (stated apart from any "_ in C^a(A)")
at-OK (b t : T) (ob : OK b) (et : Id T (tilde b) t) : OK t = subst (\ s -> OK s) et (til-OK b ob) ;
at-om (b y : T) (o : OK (om y)) (et : Id T (tilde b) (om y)) : LT y (tilde b) =
  subst (\ s -> LT y s) (sym et) (lt-om y (ot-om0 y o)) ;
at-I (b t : T) (ob : OK b) (et : Id T (tilde b) t) (h : LT t ii) : LT b ii = til-I b ob (subst (\ s -> LT s ii) (sym et) h) ;
-- Omega_{psi_q e} is psi_q e if q = I, Omega'_{psi_q e} otherwise (by definition of omF)
at-psi-t (b q e : T) (et : Id T (tilde b) (omF (psi q e))) (t : Tr (isI q)) : Id T (tilde b) (psi q e) =
  trans et (ifT-t (isI q) (psi q e) (om (psi q e)) t) ;
at-psi-f (b q e : T) (et : Id T (tilde b) (omF (psi q e))) (n : Id Bool (isI q) false) : Id T (tilde b) (om (psi q e)) =
  trans et (ifT-f (isI q) (psi q e) (om (psi q e)) n) ;
at-psi-I (b q e : T) (t : Tr (isI q)) (et : Id T (tilde b) (psi q e)) : Id T (tilde b) (psi ii e) =
  subst (\ r -> Id T (tilde b) (psi r e)) (isI-true q t) et ;
-- x <' b~ or x = b~, from x <' b~+1
at-suc (b x : T) (ob : OK b) (ox : OK x) (h : LT x (suc (tilde b))) : Tr (le x (tilde b)) =
  lt-suc-le' x (tilde b) ox (til-OK b ob) h ;

-- b~ in C^b(A) gives b~ in C^{b~}(A) (4.7(a)), written at t = b~
g-own (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (b t : T) (ob : OK b) (et : Id T (tilde b) t) (g : C b A t) : C t A t =
  ca-sup (tilde b) t A t et (fw (C b A t) (C (tilde b) A t) (rem47a A hA b ob t) g) ;

-- b~ = Omega'_y:  y in C^{b~}(A) = C^b(A), y <' b~, step 1
g2-om (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (b c y : T) (gh : GH b c) (o : OK (om y)) (et : Id T (tilde b) (om y))
  (g : C b A (om y)) : C c A (om y) =
  bw (C c A (om y)) (Or (Cap A c (om y)) (C c A y)) (ca-om c A y o)
    (inr (either (Cap A (om y) (om y)) (C (om y) A y) (C c A y)
            (\ q -> irr-abs (C c A y) (om y) q.2)
            (\ cy -> g1 A b c gh y (ot-om0 y o) (at-om b y o et)
                       (bw (C b A y) (C (tilde b) A y) (rem47a A hA b gh.1 y) (ca-sup-r (om y) (tilde b) A y et cy)))
            (fw (C (om y) A (om y)) (Or (Cap A (om y) (om y)) (C (om y) A y)) (ca-om (om y) A y o)
               (g-own A hA b (om y) gh.1 et g)))) ;

-- b~ = psi_I e:  b~ <' I, so b, c <' I;  e in C^{b~}(A) gives e in C^c(A) by (e)
g2-psi-p (A : Cl) (b c e : T) (gh : GH b c) (o : OK (psi ii e)) (et : Id T (tilde b) (psi ii e))
  (p : PsiP (psi ii e) A ii e) : C c A e =
  fw (C (psi ii e) A e) (C c A e)
    (rem47e A e (ot-T e (ot-psi1 ii e o)) (psi ii e) c
       (o, (le-refl (psi ii e), p.1))
       (gh.2.1, (subst (\ t -> Tr (le t c)) et gh.2.2.1,
                 mI-lt b c gh.2.2.2 (at-I b (psi ii e) gh.1 et p.1)))
       e (ot-psi1 ii e o) (inc-self e o))
    p.2.2 ;
g2-psi (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (b c e : T) (gh : GH b c) (o : OK (psi ii e)) (et : Id T (tilde b) (psi ii e))
  (g : C b A (psi ii e)) : C c A (psi ii e) =
  bw (C c A (psi ii e)) (Or (Cap A c (psi ii e)) (PsiP c A ii e)) (ca-psi c A ii e o)
    (inr (either (Cap A (psi ii e) (psi ii e)) (PsiP (psi ii e) A ii e) (PsiP c A ii e)
            (\ q -> irr-abs (PsiP c A ii e) (psi ii e) q.2)
            (\ p -> (mI-lt b c gh.2.2.2 (at-I b (psi ii e) gh.1 et p.1),
                     (ca-I c A, g2-psi-p A b c e gh o et p)))
            (fw (C (psi ii e) A (psi ii e)) (Or (Cap A (psi ii e) (psi ii e)) (PsiP (psi ii e) A ii e)) (ca-psi (psi ii e) A ii e o)
               (g-own A hA b (psi ii e) gh.1 et g)))) ;

-- the two shapes, at t = b~
g2-omT (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (b c y : T) (gh : GH b c) (et : Id T (tilde b) (om y))
  (g : C b A (tilde b)) : C c A (tilde b) =
  ca-el-r c A (om y) (tilde b) et (g2-om A hA b c y gh (at-OK b (om y) gh.1 et) et (ca-el b A (tilde b) (om y) et g)) ;
g2-psiT (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (b c e : T) (gh : GH b c) (et : Id T (tilde b) (psi ii e))
  (g : C b A (tilde b)) : C c A (tilde b) =
  ca-el-r c A (psi ii e) (tilde b) et (g2-psi A hA b c e gh (at-OK b (psi ii e) gh.1 et) et (ca-el b A (tilde b) (psi ii e) et g)) ;

-- b~ = Omega_y (2.14(f)), by cases on y (definition of Omega_y)
g2 (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (b c : T) (gh : GH b c) : (y : T) -> Id T (tilde b) (omF y) -> C b A (tilde b) -> C c A (tilde b) = split {
  zero -> \ et g -> ca-el-r c A zero (tilde b) et (ca-zero c A) ;
  plus x0 xs -> \ et g -> g2-omT A hA b c (plus x0 xs) gh et g ;
  phi x0 x1 -> \ et g -> g2-omT A hA b c (phi x0 x1) gh et g ;
  psi q e -> \ et g -> boolCases (C c A (tilde b)) (isI q)
    (\ t -> g2-psiT A hA b c e gh (at-psi-I b q e t (at-psi-t b q e et t)) g)
    (\ n -> g2-omT A hA b c (psi q e) gh (at-psi-f b q e et n) g) ;
  om x0 -> \ et g -> g2-omT A hA b c (om x0) gh et g ;
  ii -> \ et g -> ca-el-r c A ii (tilde b) et (ca-I c A) } ;

-- step 2
g-top (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (b c : T) (gh : GH b c) (g : C b A (tilde b)) : C c A (tilde b) =
  g2 A hA b c gh (rem214f b gh.1).1 (rem214f b gh.1).2.2.1 g ;

-- step 3: x <' b~+1 gives x <' b~ or x = b~
g3 (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (b c x : T) (gh : GH b c) (g : C b A x) (h : LT x (suc (tilde b))) : C c A x =
  orE (C c A x) (lt x (tilde b)) (eqT x (tilde b)) (at-suc b x gh.1 (ca-ok b A x g) h)
    (\ l -> g1 A b c gh x (ca-ok b A x g) l g)
    (\ e -> ca-el-r c A (tilde b) x (eqT-sound x (tilde b) e)
              (g-top A hA b c gh (ca-el b A x (tilde b) (eqT-sound x (tilde b) e) g))) ;

-- (g) A c M(A), b~ <=' c, b^{-I} = c^{-I} => C^b(A) n (b~+1) = C^c(A) n (b~+1)
rem47g (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (b c : T) (gh : GH b c)
  : Eqv (Cap (C b A) (suc (tilde b))) (Cap (C c A) (suc (tilde b))) =
  \ x -> (\ g -> (g3 A hA b c x gh g.1 g.2, g.2),
          \ g -> (bw (C b A x) (C (tilde b) A x) (rem47a A hA b gh.1 x)
                    (rem47b A hA (tilde b) c (til-OK b gh.1) gh.2.1 gh.2.2.1 x g.1), g.2)) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.9 (e)
--
-- A c M(A), a in OT, b, c in (A n a~) u (M(A) \ a~):
--   a =NF phi_b c  or  a =NF Omega_b (b = c)  =>  a in M(A);
--   a =NF b + c, A n a~ weakly downward closed for sums  =>  a in M(A).
-- Step 1 (part-in): b, c in C^a(A):  p in A n a~ gives p in A n a (4.7(h));
-- p in M(A) with a~ <=' p gives C^p(A) c C^a(A) (Down at (a, p)).  phi, Omega: 4.4(c).
-- Sums (a = cat b c; C^a(A) splits a sum at its head):
--   (S') all summands of u in C^a(A), c in C^a(A) => cat u c in C^a(A)  (sums-cat; induction on u).
--   (Q) u /= 0, p /= 0, cat p u in B (B in OT weakly downward closed) => all summands of u
--       in B, and p in B  (qq; induction on u: atom: cat p g =NF' p + g;  (u0, us):
--       cat p (u0, us) = cat (cat p u0) us, (Q) for us at cat p u0, then for u0 at p).
--   So u in B, u /= 0 => all summands of u in B (sums-of).
--   (S) u in C^a(A), c in C^a(A), cat u c in OT => cat u c in C^a(A)  (s-cat; induction on u).
--       Atom: 4.4(c).  (u0, us): by parts, induction.  By u in A n a: if u <' a~, u in
--       A n a~ = B, its summands are in B c C^a(A), and (S').  Otherwise a~ <=' u, u in M(A),
--       u in C^u(A) not by u <' u, so u0, us in C^u(A) c C^a(A) (Down at (a, u)), by parts.

-- (A n a~) u (M(A) \ a~)
Good (A : Cl) (a p : T) : U lv = Or (Cap A (tilde a) p) (M A p * Tr (le (tilde a) p)) ;

-- B weakly downward closed for sums: z in B, z =NF' x + y => x, y in B
WDC (B : Cl) : U lv = (z x y : T) -> NFsum' z x y -> B z -> B x * B y ;

-- A n a~ c C^a(A)  (4.7(h), a~ <=' a)
low-in (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a : T) (oa : OK a) : Sub (Cap A (tilde a)) (C a A) =
  \ p q -> rem47h a A p (hA p q.1).1
             (q.1, lt-le p (tilde a) a (trOT p (tilde a) a (hA p q.1).1 (til-OK a oa) oa) q.2 (til-le a oa)) ;

-- step 1
part-in (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a : T) (oa : OK a) (p : T) (g : Good A a p) : C a A p =
  either (Cap A (tilde a) p) (M A p * Tr (le (tilde a) p)) (C a A p)
    (\ q -> low-in A hA a oa p q)
    (\ m -> ca-down A hA p a p oa m.1.1 m.2 (m-c A p m.1))
    g ;

-- the OT condition along an equation a = y
nf-OK (a y : T) (e : Id T a y) (o : OK a) : OK y = subst (\ s -> OK s) e o ;

-- a =NF phi_b c
rem49e-phi (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a b c : T) (h : NFphi a b c) (gb : Good A a b) (gc : Good A a c) : M A a =
  (h.2, ca-el-r a A (phi b c) a h.1
          (bw (C a A (phi b c)) (Or (Cap A a (phi b c)) (C a A b * C a A c)) (ca-phi a A b c (nf-OK a (phi b c) h.1 h.2))
             (inr (part-in A hA a h.2 b gb, part-in A hA a h.2 c gc)))) ;

-- a =NF Omega_b
rem49e-om (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a b : T) (h : NFom a b) (gb : Good A a b) : M A a =
  (h.2, ca-el-r a A (om b) a h.1
          (bw (C a A (om b)) (Or (Cap A a (om b)) (C a A b)) (ca-om a A b (nf-OK a (om b) h.1 h.2))
             (inr (part-in A hA a h.2 b gb)))) ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Summands

-- all summands of u are in D (by recursion on u)
Sums (D : Cl) : T -> U lv = split {
  zero -> One ;
  plus x0 xs | _ rs -> D x0 * rs ;
  phi x0 x1 -> D (phi x0 x1) ;
  psi x0 x1 -> D (psi x0 x1) ;
  om x0 -> D (om x0) ;
  ii -> D ii } ;

-- for an atom, Sums D g is D g (by definition of Sums)
sums-A (D : Cl) : (g : T) -> Tr (isA g) -> Sums D g -> D g = split {
  zero -> \ h s -> abF h ; plus x0 xs -> \ h s -> abF h ;
  phi x0 x1 -> \ h s -> s ; psi x0 x1 -> \ h s -> s ; om x0 -> \ h s -> s ; ii -> \ h s -> s } ;

sums-map (D E : Cl) (f : Sub D E) : (u : T) -> Sums D u -> Sums E u = split {
  zero -> \ s -> tt ;
  plus x0 xs | _ r -> \ s -> (f x0 s.1, r s.2) ;
  phi x0 x1 -> \ s -> f (phi x0 x1) s ;
  psi x0 x1 -> \ s -> f (psi x0 x1) s ;
  om x0 -> \ s -> f (om x0) s ;
  ii -> \ s -> f ii s } ;

-- cat is associative (induction on x)
cat-assoc : (x y z : T) -> Id T (cat (cat x y) z) (cat x (cat y z)) = split {
  zero -> \ y z -> refl (cat y z) ;
  plus x0 xs | _ r -> \ y z -> ap (\ s -> plus x0 s) (r y z) ;
  phi x0 x1 -> \ y z -> refl (plus (phi x0 x1) (cat y z)) ;
  psi x0 x1 -> \ y z -> refl (plus (psi x0 x1) (cat y z)) ;
  om x0 -> \ y z -> refl (plus (om x0) (cat y z)) ;
  ii -> \ y z -> refl (plus ii (cat y z)) } ;

cat-NZ : (y : T) -> NZ y -> (z : T) -> NZ (cat y z) = split {
  zero -> \ h z -> abT h ; plus x0 xs -> \ h z -> refl false ; phi x0 x1 -> \ h z -> refl false ;
  psi x0 x1 -> \ h z -> refl false ; om x0 -> \ h z -> refl false ; ii -> \ h z -> refl false } ;

-- (g, z) in T' for an atom g, z /= 0 (by definition of isT)
tt-plusA (g z : T) (hA : Tr (isA g)) (tg : TT g) (tz : TT z) (nz : NZ z) : TT (plus g z) =
  andI (and (isA g) (isT g)) (and (not (isZero z)) (isT z)) (andI (isA g) (isT g) hA tg) (andI (not (isZero z)) (isT z) (ap not nz) tz) ;

cat-TT : (y : T) -> TT y -> NZ y -> (z : T) -> TT z -> NZ z -> TT (cat y z) = split {
  zero -> \ ty ny z tz nz -> abT ny ;
  plus y0 ys | _ r -> \ ty ny z tz nz ->
    tt-plusA y0 (cat ys z) (isT-plusA y0 ys ty) (isT-plus0 y0 ys ty)
      (r (isT-plusS y0 ys ty) (tail-nz y0 ys ty) z tz nz) (cat-NZ ys (tail-nz y0 ys ty) z) ;
  phi x0 x1 -> \ ty ny z tz nz -> tt-plusA (phi x0 x1) z (refl true) ty tz nz ;
  psi x0 x1 -> \ ty ny z tz nz -> tt-plusA (psi x0 x1) z (refl true) ty tz nz ;
  om x0 -> \ ty ny z tz nz -> tt-plusA (om x0) z (refl true) ty tz nz ;
  ii -> \ ty ny z tz nz -> tt-plusA ii z (refl true) ty tz nz } ;

-- (Q), for B c OT weakly downward closed
QQ (B : Cl) (u : T) : U lv = (p : T) -> TT p -> NZ p -> B (cat p u) -> Sums B u * B p ;

q-atom (B : Cl) (bOK : (x : T) -> B x -> OK x) (wd : WDC B) (g : T) (hg : Tr (isA g)) (tg : TT g)
  (p : T) (tp : TT p) (np : NZ p) (h : B (cat p g)) : B g * B p =
  let { w : B p * B g = wd (cat p g) p g ((refl (cat p g), (tp, (tg, (np, (A-nz g hg, bOK (cat p g) h))))), hg) h ; }
  in (w.2, w.1) ;

-- cat p (u0, us) = cat (cat p u0) us
cat-step (p u0 us : T) (hA : Tr (isA u0)) : Id T (cat (cat p u0) us) (cat p (plus u0 us)) =
  trans (cat-assoc p u0 us) (ap (\ s -> cat p s) (cat-A u0 hA us)) ;
b-step (B : Cl) (p u0 us : T) (hA : Tr (isA u0)) (h : B (cat p (plus u0 us))) : B (cat (cat p u0) us) =
  subst (\ s -> B s) (sym (cat-step p u0 us hA)) h ;

q-plus (B : Cl) (u0 us : T) (r0 : QQ B u0) (rs : QQ B us) (tu : TT (plus u0 us)) : QQ B (plus u0 us) =
  \ p tp np h ->
    let { s : Sums B us * B (cat p u0) =
            rs (cat p u0) (cat-TT p tp np u0 (isT-plus0 u0 us tu) (A-nz u0 (isT-plusA u0 us tu))) (cat-NZ p np u0)
               (b-step B p u0 us (isT-plusA u0 us tu) h) ;
          t : Sums B u0 * B p = r0 p tp np s.2 ; }
    in ((sums-A B u0 (isT-plusA u0 us tu) t.1, s.1), t.2) ;

qq (B : Cl) (bOK : (x : T) -> B x -> OK x) (wd : WDC B) : (u : T) -> TT u -> NZ u -> QQ B u = split {
  zero -> \ t n -> abT n ;
  plus u0 us | r0 rs -> \ t n -> q-plus B u0 us (r0 (isT-plus0 u0 us t) (A-nz u0 (isT-plusA u0 us t))) (rs (isT-plusS u0 us t) (tail-nz u0 us t)) t ;
  phi x0 x1 -> \ t n -> q-atom B bOK wd (phi x0 x1) (refl true) t ;
  psi x0 x1 -> \ t n -> q-atom B bOK wd (psi x0 x1) (refl true) t ;
  om x0 -> \ t n -> q-atom B bOK wd (om x0) (refl true) t ;
  ii -> \ t n -> q-atom B bOK wd ii (refl true) t } ;

-- u in B, u /= 0 => all summands of u in B  ((u0, us) = cat u0 us, (Q) for us at u0)
sums-of (B : Cl) (bOK : (x : T) -> B x -> OK x) (wd : WDC B) : (u : T) -> TT u -> NZ u -> B u -> Sums B u = split {
  zero -> \ t n h -> abT n ;
  plus u0 us -> \ t n h ->
    let { s : Sums B us * B u0 =
            qq B bOK wd us (isT-plusS u0 us t) (tail-nz u0 us t) u0 (isT-plus0 u0 us t) (A-nz u0 (isT-plusA u0 us t))
              (subst (\ x -> B x) (sym (cat-A u0 (isT-plusA u0 us t) us)) h) ; }
    in (s.2, s.1) ;
  phi x0 x1 -> \ t n h -> h ;
  psi x0 x1 -> \ t n h -> h ;
  om x0 -> \ t n h -> h ;
  ii -> \ t n h -> h } ;

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Lemma 4.9 (e), sums

-- (S')
sums-cat (a : T) (A : Cl) : (u : T) -> Sums (C a A) u -> (c : T) -> C a A c -> OK (cat u c) -> C a A (cat u c) = split {
  zero -> \ s c hc o -> hc ;
  plus u0 us | _ r -> \ s c hc o ->
    bw (C a A (plus u0 (cat us c))) (Or (Cap A a (plus u0 (cat us c))) (C a A u0 * C a A (cat us c))) (ca-plus a A u0 (cat us c) o)
      (inr (s.1, r s.2 c hc (ot-plusS u0 (cat us c) o))) ;
  phi x0 x1 -> \ s c hc o ->
    bw (C a A (plus (phi x0 x1) c)) (Or (Cap A a (plus (phi x0 x1) c)) (C a A (phi x0 x1) * C a A c)) (ca-plus a A (phi x0 x1) c o) (inr (s, hc)) ;
  psi x0 x1 -> \ s c hc o ->
    bw (C a A (plus (psi x0 x1) c)) (Or (Cap A a (plus (psi x0 x1) c)) (C a A (psi x0 x1) * C a A c)) (ca-plus a A (psi x0 x1) c o) (inr (s, hc)) ;
  om x0 -> \ s c hc o ->
    bw (C a A (plus (om x0) c)) (Or (Cap A a (plus (om x0) c)) (C a A (om x0) * C a A c)) (ca-plus a A (om x0) c o) (inr (s, hc)) ;
  ii -> \ s c hc o ->
    bw (C a A (plus ii c)) (Or (Cap A a (plus ii c)) (C a A ii * C a A c)) (ca-plus a A ii c o) (inr (s, hc)) } ;

-- (S), the hypothesis on us
SH (a : T) (A : Cl) (us : T) : U lv = TT us -> C a A us -> (c : T) -> C a A c -> OK (cat us c) -> C a A (cat us c) ;

-- (S) for (u0, us), by parts
s-parts (a : T) (A : Cl) (u0 us : T) (r : SH a A us) (t : TT (plus u0 us)) (p : C a A u0 * C a A us)
  (c : T) (hc : C a A c) (o : OK (plus u0 (cat us c))) : C a A (plus u0 (cat us c)) =
  bw (C a A (plus u0 (cat us c))) (Or (Cap A a (plus u0 (cat us c))) (C a A u0 * C a A (cat us c))) (ca-plus a A u0 (cat us c) o)
    (inr (p.1, r (isT-plusS u0 us t) p.2 c hc (ot-plusS u0 (cat us c) o))) ;

-- (S) for u = (u0, us) in A n a
s-own (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a : T) (oa : OK a) (wd : WDC (Cap A (tilde a))) (u0 us : T) (r : SH a A us)
  (t : TT (plus u0 us)) (ou : OK (plus u0 us)) (q : Cap A a (plus u0 us))
  (c : T) (hc : C a A c) (o : OK (plus u0 (cat us c))) : C a A (plus u0 (cat us c)) =
  boolCases (C a A (plus u0 (cat us c))) (lt (plus u0 us) (tilde a))
    (\ l -> sums-cat a A (plus u0 us)
              (sums-map (Cap A (tilde a)) (C a A) (low-in A hA a oa) (plus u0 us)
                 (sums-of (Cap A (tilde a)) (\ x h -> (hA x h.1).1) wd (plus u0 us) t (refl false) (q.1, l)))
              c hc o)
    (\ n -> s-parts a A u0 us r t
              (either (Cap A (plus u0 us) (plus u0 us)) (C (plus u0 us) A u0 * C (plus u0 us) A us) (C a A u0 * C a A us)
                 (\ q' -> irr-abs (C a A u0 * C a A us) (plus u0 us) q'.2)
                 (\ p -> (ca-down A hA u0 a (plus u0 us) oa ou (nlt-le (tilde a) (plus u0 us) (ot-T (tilde a) (til-OK a oa)) t n) p.1,
                          ca-down A hA us a (plus u0 us) oa ou (nlt-le (tilde a) (plus u0 us) (ot-T (tilde a) (til-OK a oa)) t n) p.2))
                 (fw (C (plus u0 us) A (plus u0 us)) (Or (Cap A (plus u0 us) (plus u0 us)) (C (plus u0 us) A u0 * C (plus u0 us) A us))
                    (ca-plus (plus u0 us) A u0 us ou) (m-c A (plus u0 us) (hA (plus u0 us) q.1))))
              c hc o) ;

-- an atom g: (g, c) by parts
s-atom (a : T) (A : Cl) (g c : T) (hu : C a A g) (hc : C a A c) (o : OK (plus g c)) : C a A (plus g c) =
  bw (C a A (plus g c)) (Or (Cap A a (plus g c)) (C a A g * C a A c)) (ca-plus a A g c o) (inr (hu, hc)) ;

-- (S)
s-cat (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a : T) (oa : OK a) (wd : WDC (Cap A (tilde a))) : (u : T) -> SH a A u = split {
  zero -> \ t hu c hc o -> hc ;
  plus u0 us | _ r -> \ t hu c hc o ->
    either (Cap A a (plus u0 us)) (C a A u0 * C a A us) (C a A (plus u0 (cat us c)))
      (\ q -> s-own A hA a oa wd u0 us r t (ca-ok a A (plus u0 us) hu) q c hc o)
      (\ p -> s-parts a A u0 us r t p c hc o)
      (fw (C a A (plus u0 us)) (Or (Cap A a (plus u0 us)) (C a A u0 * C a A us)) (ca-plus a A u0 us (ca-ok a A (plus u0 us) hu)) hu) ;
  phi x0 x1 -> \ t hu c hc o -> s-atom a A (phi x0 x1) c hu hc o ;
  psi x0 x1 -> \ t hu c hc o -> s-atom a A (psi x0 x1) c hu hc o ;
  om x0 -> \ t hu c hc o -> s-atom a A (om x0) c hu hc o ;
  ii -> \ t hu c hc o -> s-atom a A ii c hu hc o } ;

-- (e) for a =NF b + c, with A n a~ weakly downward closed
rem49e-sum (A : Cl) (hA : Sub A (M A)) (a b c : T) (h : NFsum a b c) (wd : WDC (Cap A (tilde a)))
  (gb : Good A a b) (gc : Good A a c) : M A a =
  (h.2.2.2.2.2, ca-el-r a A (cat b c) a h.1
     (s-cat A hA a h.2.2.2.2.2 wd b h.2.1 (part-in A hA a h.2.2.2.2.2 b gb) c (part-in A hA a h.2.2.2.2.2 c gc)
        (nf-OK a (cat b c) h.1 h.2.2.2.2.2))) ;
